hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1002","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Taif se lautnay ke baad Jirana maqam par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne jahiliyat mein aik din Masjid-ul-Haram mein etikaf karnay ki nazr ki thi, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is ke baaray mein kya farmatay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ja aur aik din ka etikaf kar. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khums mein se aik londi un ko inayat ki thi, jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sab qaidiyon ko azaad kar diya to Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ki aawazein sunein, wo keh rahay thay ke hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne azaad kar diya. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne poocha ye kya keh rahay hain? Logon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qaidiyon ko azaad kar diya hai. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne betay se kaha ke Ae Abdullah! Us londi ke paas ja aur us ko bhi chhor de. (Muslim: 5/89). Baab: Nazr poori karnay ka hukm."
"1003","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke Sa'd bin Ubada (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se masala poocha ke meri maan par nazr thi aur wo us ke ada karnay se pehle hi faut ho gayi, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ki taraf se tu ada kar de. (Muslim: 5/76). Baab: Jo Kaaba tak paidal janay ki nazr manay."
"1004","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri behan ne nazr maani ke Baitullah tak nangay paon paidal jaye gi, to mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochnay ka kaha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke paidal bhi chalay aur sawaar bhi ho jaye. (Muslim: 5/79)"
"1005","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik boorhay ko dekha jo apne donon beton ke darmiyan, un par, tek lagaye ja raha tha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha ke us ko kya hua hai? Logon ne kaha ke us ne paidal chalnay ki nazr maani hai, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala us ke apne nafs ko azaab mein mubtala karnay se beparwah hai aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko sawaar honay ka hukm kiya. (Muslim: 5/79). Baab: Nazr se mumaniat aur ke wo kuch nahi rokta."
"1006","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nazr se mana farmaya aur farmaya ke is se koi faida nahi hota, yani koi aanay wali bala nahi rukti aur taqdeer nahi badalti. Ye sirf balke bakheel se maal nikalwanay ka zariya hai, yani bakheel yun to khairaat nahi karta aur jab aafat aati hai to nazr hi ke bahanay rupiya deta hai aur miskeenon ko faida hota hai. (Muslim: 5/77)"
"1007","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nazr kisi aisi cheez ko aadmi se nazdeek nahi karti jo Allah Taala ne us ki taqdeer mein nahi likhi lekin nazr taqdeer ke muwafiq hoti hai. Nazr ki wajah se bakheel ke paas se wo maal nikalta hai jis ko wo nikalna nahi chahta. (Muslim: 5/77-78)"
"1008","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Saqeef aur Banu Uqail aik doosray ke haleef thay. Saqeef ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se do shakhson ko qaid kar liya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ne Banu Uqail mein se aik shakhs ko giraftar kar liya aur Azba, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki oontni, ko bhi us ke saath pakra. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas aaye aur wo bandha hua tha. Us ne kaha Ae Muhammad! Ae Muhammad! Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas gaye aur poocha ke kya kehta hai? Wo bola ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe kis qasoor mein pakra aur hajiyon ki oontniyon par sabqat le janay wali, yani Azba ko, kis qasoor mein pakra hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke bara qasoor hai aur main ne tujhe tere dost Saqeef ke qasoor ke badlay mein pakra hai. Ye keh kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chalay to us ne phir pukara Ae Muhammad, Ae Muhammad! Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nihayat rahem dil aur meharban thay Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) phir us ki taraf lautay aur poocha ke kya kehta hai? Wo bola ke main Musalman hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye baat agar tu us waqt kehta jab tu apne kaam ka mukhtar tha, yani giraftar nahi hua tha, to bilkul nijaat pata. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) lautay to us ne phir pukara Ae Muhammad, Ae Muhammad! Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) phir aaye aur poocha ke kya kehta hai? Wo bola ke main bhooka hun mujhe khana khilaiye aur main pyasa hun mujhe pani pilaiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye le, yani khana pani us ko diya. Phir wo un do shakhson ke badlay chhora gaya jin ko Saqeef ne qaid kar liya tha. Rawi ne kaha ke Ansaar ki aik aurat qaid ho gayi aur Azba bhi qaid ho gayi. Phir wo aurat bandhi hui thi aur kafir apne gharon ke saamnay apne janwaron ko aaram de rahay thay ke us ne apne aap ko bandhanon se azaad kar liya aur oonton ke paas aayi, jis oont ke paas jati wo aawaz karta to wo us ko chhor deti, yahan tak ke Azba ke paas aayi to us ne aawaz nahi ki aur wo bari maskeen, shareef, oontni thi. Aurat ne us ki peeth par baith kar us ko daanta to wo chali. Kafiron ko khabar ho gayi to wo Azba ke peechay chalay, apni apni oontni par sawaar ho kar, lekin Azba ne un ko thaka diya, yani koi pakar na saka ke Azba itni taizru thi. Us aurat ne nazr maani ke Ae Allah! Agar Azba mujhe bacha le jaye to main us ki qurbani karun gi. Jab wo aurat Madina mein aayi aur logon ne dekha to kaha ke ye to Azba Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki oontni hai. Wo aurat boli ke main ne nazr ki hai ke agar Azba par Allah Taala mujhe nijaat de to us ko nahr karun gi. Ye sun kar sahaba Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne taajjub se farmaya ke SubhanAllah! Us aurat ne Azba ko kya bura badla diya, yani Azba ne to us ki jaan bachayi aur wo Azba ki jaan lena chahti hai. Us ne nazr maani ke agar Allah Taala Azba ki peeth par us ko nijaat de to wo Azba hi ki qurbani karay gi. Jo nazr gunah ke liye ki jaye wo poori na ki jaye aur na wo nazr poori ki jaye jis ka insaan maalik nahi. (Muslim: 5/78). Baab: Nazr ke kaffaray ke baaray mein. (Saqeef aur Uqail do qabeelay hain; haleef se murad muahid hai; Azba manuqqa, seedhi hui oontni thi.)"
"1009","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nazr ka kaffara wohi hai jo qasam ka kaffara hai, yani das miskeenon ko khana khilana ya das miskeenon ko libas pehnana ya ghulam azaad karna. Agar in kaamon ki taqat na ho to teen din ke rozay rakhna. (Muslim: 5/80)"
